<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="2TH" style="id">Tutsa: Bible Translation 1st Edition</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF8)</para>
  <para style="h">2 Thesoloniite</para>
  <para style="toc1">THESOLONIITE suh Pool ih Taklih raang arah Le</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Thesoloniite</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Thes</para>
  <para style="mt1">THESOLONIITE</para>
  <para style="mt2">Suh Pool Ih Taklih Raang Arah Le</para>
  <para style="imt">Ephangjatjih</para>
  <para style="ip">Jisu Kristo ngaak raaha ih banthoothak rumta tiit tungthoih Thesoloni Chaas ni moongsaam thok ang ruh ih rumla. <char style="bk">Thesoloniite suh Pol liwang leeraang adi</char> Teesu eraak eha ih hanpi rumta rangwuung ah ejen thok ih taha ih raangha. Pool ih erah tiit ah hukbaat kotsuh thunha, Jisu maang ngaak raara ngakhoh nah, ethih nyia lalangka loong ah phang thok ha, neng phansiitte ah Kristo damdoh thichomuite warah heh men ah “Jootthih Wah” ih poonha.</para>
  <para style="ip">Heh kaamwah ih arah wette loong asuh neng hanpi nah echam enaang lam ih ang abah uh rongtangtang toom ang rum ih hukbaat korumha, Pool nyia heh joonte loong mota ah likhiik, mootkaat ese ah motheng eah.</para>
  <para style="iot">Hemong Dowa Jatjih</para>
  <para style="io1">Ephangjatjih <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2TH 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Rangphoong nyia Tiitse Baat kot<char style="ior">(<ref loc="2TH 1:3-12">1:3-12</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kristo Raaha Tiit Lamphan baat kot <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2TH 2:1-17">2:1-17</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kristaan Reeraang Tiit Baattaan<char style="ior">(<ref loc="2TH 3:1-15">3:1-15</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Hethoonhemat <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2TH 3:16-18">3:16-18</ref>)</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 17:1">Esm 17:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Thesoloni Chaas nawa sen loong wah Rangte nyia Teesu Jisu Kristo mina loong suh—Pool, Silaas, nyia Timothi loong jiin nawa:</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Sen loong Wah Rangte nyia Teesu Jisu Kristo ih sen suh semroongroong nyia minchan ah toom kohan.</para>
  <para style="s">Jisu raaha sa doh dande</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Joon awaan loong, seng ih Rangte suh saapoot rookwet lakookmi ih sen loong thoi eli jih jaat angla. Eno erah epun eah, tumeah sen loong hanpi ah hak ela erah dam ih sen chamchi nah minchan mui ah ehan ih donghoonla. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Erah thoih seng ih sen tiit ah Rangte Chaas rookwih ni khuungpook baat hi. Sen hanpi ah sen chamnaang nyia phate joonnaam di nep latoohaat thang ih naan jahalan asuh seng khooroh eli.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Erah loong reetan ah sok adi Rangte ih epun dande eha, erah thoidoh sen loong ah heh Hasong nah wangsuh epun ang an. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Rangte ah epun jaatjaat ih re ah: heh ih sen cham thukte loong ah ewe cham thuk et ah, <verse number="7" style="v"/>eno sen echam etan loong ah takah cham thuk ran sen damdam seng loong asuh nep ah. Teesu Jisu ah rangmong nawa heh chaan aphaan pan rangsah loong damdoh dong raaha sa doh erah loong ah re ah, <verse number="8" style="v"/>eno o ih Rangte thaangju ha nyia Teesu Jisu, Ruurang Ese ah laboichaatte loong ah weeluung nah cham thuk suh raaha. <verse number="9" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 2:10">Isa 2:10</ref></char></note>Neng babah uh lathoon theng ethih adoh chamnaang rum ah, Teesu jiin nawa nyia heh chaan aphaan nawa pheehoom cho ang rum ah, <verse number="10" style="v"/>heh erah Sa doh heh mina loong jiin nawa chaan ah thaang raaha doh nyia heh suh hanpiite loong jiin nawa esoomtu theng ah thaang raaha doh, sen uh neng damdoh roong ang an, tumeah sen ih seng ih baatti jengkhaap loong ah ehanpi ehan.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Erah raangtaan ih seng ih sen suh saarookwih rangsoom ni tongli. Sen loong songtong suh Rangte ih poon halan adoh jen pun suh sen raang ih Rangte suh rangsoom hi. Sen tuungmaang lan mootkaat ah jen tom mootkaat suh nyia sen tenthun ese ah jen reeraang suh Rangte chaan nawa ih ju toom ang ah. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Emamah ih seng Teesu Jisu men ah sen nawa ih toom rangka ah, eno sen uh heh nawa ih rangka han, seng Rangte nyi Teesu Jisu Kristo minchan ah sen damdoh toom angha.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Mih lajak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1TH 4:15-17">1Thes 4:15-17</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Teesu Jisu Kristo raaha tiit nyia seng heh damdoh thutthi theng tiit: Ngah ih sen lasih joh rumhala, joon awaan loong, <verse number="2" style="v"/>Teesu Rangwuung ah ejen thok ih taha ih baatte ih sen ah seek ih naktoom jen mokwaan han adoleh nak toom thungjoong thuk han. Erah loong jengkhaap ah seng ih chiiala tiit baat tokdi, Rangte tiit tumbaat tokdi, adoleh leeraang nawa ih raangmaat erah likhiik mok ih thokbaat tahan bah sen seek ih lapaatja theng nyia ladoonmoh theng. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Marah lam nawa eh uh mih ih sen ah naktoom jen mokwaan han. Erah Rangwuung ah thok suh bah heh damdoh Tootmuite chaak thok ha nyia soolam nah wangte Lajak ah dong eha. <verse number="4" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 11:36">Dan 11:36</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 28:2">Ijk 28:2</ref></char></note> Heh ih ranghoh loong rangsoom ah thaangju ano heh teeteewah suh loongtang nang ih echoong thoon ih thiik ah. Heh Rangteenok nah nep tongwang ah eno heteewah ah Rangte ih chaang ah. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Sen ih tatam dokthun kan? Ngah sen damdi ang tokdi kabaat rum taha rah ah? <verse number="6" style="v"/>Enoothong erah amadi lah angthukte tumjih bah uh eje, eno erah tumjih ah sen ih ejat ehan. Heh saapoot doh, erah Lajak mih ah edong eha. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Erah Mikmuh Lajak ah amadi husah ni ejen moh ela, enoothong heh tangjootte wah ah helam nawa maang dok haathaat bah tumjih angjih angta ah tajen ang thukka. <verse number="8" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:4">Isa 11:4</ref></char></note> Erah linah bah Lajak Mih ah dong ha, enoothong Teesu Jisu ah ra haano, heh tu nawa heh tak ih mot ano tek haat ah nyia heh dong ha doh heh weephaak phaakjaaja rah ih thet haat et ah. <verse number="9" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:24">Mat 24:24</ref></char></note> Lajak mih ah dong haano Soitaan chaan aphaan nawa ih emoong lamko nawa jaatrep epaatjaajih nyia elaksok etheng loong ah re ah, <verse number="10" style="v"/>eno emat ete loong ah jaatrep ethih lamko nah moong mokwaan ah. Neng emat eah tumeah neng ih neng khopuitheng amiisak tiit ah tanoppoon rumka nyia minchan asuh tanook rumka. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Erah thoih Rangte ih emoong chaan aphaan ah neng dung nah toom moh ah ih daapkaatta tumeah emoong ah neng ih toom hanpi rum ah eah. <verse number="12" style="v"/>O ang abah uh amiisak tiit asuh lahanpi thang ih, rangdah tenroon adi tongte loong ah edut haat etjih ih dong hoon ah.</para>
  <para style="s">Khopiiroidong raang ih danje tahan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Joon awaan loong, sen Teesu ih minchan halan loong thoi, saapoot rookwih seng ih Rangte suh lakookmi liijih jaatjaat. Tumeah Rangte ih sen ah Esa Chiiala chaan nawa ih esa mina ih hoon suh phangkhothoon ih danje halan, sen amiisak asuh tuungmaang thoih ah. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Rangte ih arah tuk ih poon halan langla seng ih sen suh Ruurang Ese ah baattaan thoi; Teesu Jisu Kristo chaan aphaan ah toomroong choh an ih poon halan. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Erah thoih, joon awaan loong, rongrong ih tong an, eno marah amiisak tiit jengkhaap nawa ih nyia le nawa ih maat raang heeno nyootsootti loong ah dangdang ih kap an.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Seng Teesu Jisu Kristo heteewah nyia seng loong Wah Rangte, seng minchante wah, seng suh lathoon theng tenchaan tenthun, heh tenthet nyia laalom ah toom kohan, <verse number="17" style="v"/>sen suh saarookwih tenthun chaan theng nyia tathat theng ese reeraang nyia jeng akong ah toom kohan.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Rangsoom Kohe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hethoondi, joon awaan loong, seng suh rangsoom kohe Teesu tiitkhaap ah seekseek ih toom jaatjaang ah eno sen ih soongraang han ah likhiik toom et soongraang ah. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Rangte ih lajak nyia ethih nawa nep toom panghe suh rangsoom kohe, tumeah warep ih tiitkhaap ah tahanpiika.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Enoothong Rangte abah ehanpi Rangte, heh ih sen suh tathat kohanno Ethih Esiit dowa piipang et han. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Sen loong ah moh elan ih Teesu suh kamkam ih laalomli eno emamah ban moh ruh ju ean seng ih marah baat hi rah ah.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Seng Teesu ih sen tenthun mongtham ah Rangte minchan nah nyia Kristo ih naanta ah toom jen samthun thuk han.</para>
  <para style="s">Edem loong suh mootkaat baat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Joon awaan loong, Jisu Kristo mendi baat rumhala, hanpiite edem loong jiin nawa sen ah haloh ih tong an, neng suh seng ih jaatrep taat nyootbaatti ang abah uh neng ih taphan rumka. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Seng mame moti erah likhiik sen uh emamah ih mojih ih sen ih naririh jat han. Sen damdi ang tokdi seng ah edem tah angti. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Seng ih thaangmuh ih o dowa uh tathaang phaksati. Erah nang ih seng rangwuung rangphe ih chamnaang moti, sen phoh looso ki ih thun ih no ah. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Seng erah reeti ah langla seng ih tajen jamsuke ebah tah angta, sen ih toom nyootsok he ih reeti. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Seng sen damdi ang tahe adi botseh arah banlam ah kabaatti, “O mootkaat tanookka erah ih laphaksah theng.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Seng ih sengdung ni edem mina mararah ah eje tih nyia tumjih lamoh thang ih wahoh pheehoon mootkaat phaangphakte eje ih chaat ih no baat hi. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Teesu Jisu Kristo mendi seng ih erah mina loong asuh dangdang ih baat hi neng roidong doh biiphaksah rum ano neng hasong ah phanjangjang toom ih tongsong rum ah.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Enoothong joon awaan loong, sen ah ese mootkaat moh suh nakmok naang an. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Seng ih arah le maat raang hali dowa jengkhaap ah lakapte uh eje ang ah. Emate je abah, naririh ih ba danjat an, eno neng damdoh tumjih uh lathaam waan theng, eno ba neng rakriiri eah. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Enoothong, sen piiara likhiik nak et thiik an, erah nang ih bah, hanpiite jun ih choophaan baat an.</para>
  <para style="s">Hethoon jengkhaap</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Seng Teesu semroongroong kotte wah, ih sen suh jaatrep lampo nah saapoot rookwih semroongroong ah toom kohan. Sen damdam Teesu toomroong tongha. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Arah nga teeteewah lak ih raanghang: <char style="sig">Pool jiin nawa Jengkhaapse </char> Leeraang rookwih ni amah ju kah ih raang ang; erah thoih arah raanghang. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Seng Teesu Jisu Kristo minchan ah sen damdam toom tongha.</para>
</usx>
